"Covered Material" means original contributions made for the WowVoice Forever
Beta adaptation, including additions, modifications, development tools, tests
and documentation, only to the extent that the contributors offering this
license ("Licensors") hold the relevant rights. "You" means the recipient
exercising the permissions granted below. This license does not license the
entire addon or grant rights to underlying or third-party material.

2. Excluded material and upstream status
---------------------------------------

* Original WowVoice code and data by the upstream WowVoice author(s), including
  the underlying portions of modified files, Index.lua and Durations.lua:
  https://github.com/HappyDridex/wowvoice
  https://github.com/HappyDridex/wowvoice/releases/tag/v1.0
  No copyright license was found on 2026-09-26 in the GitHub repository or in
  WowVoice-classic-1.15.zip and WowVoice-midnight-12.0.7-addon.zip from v1.0.
  The CurseForge license could not be verified. Upstream permissions remain
  unresolved; this file does not grant permission to redistribute or relicense
  that material. Obtain the applicable terms from its rights holder(s).
  License.lua configures audio activation; it is not a copyright license.
* Original audio packs, downloaded separately, are not covered by this license.
* Blizzard Entertainment artwork, including Media/TalkingHeads.tga, remains
  third-party material. See src/Media/NOTICE.txt in the repository or
  WowVoice/Media/NOTICE.txt in the release archive.
* Model identities derived from the WoW community listfile in CameraModels.lua
  are excluded from this grant:
  https://github.com/wowdev/wow-listfile/releases/tag/202609242243
* Third-party development dependencies retain their own licenses.

